{
  "message": "The Godot demo projects and art style reference provide starting material for your game. The playable goal is at risk: the devlog gives no build link, leaving the jump and first level unverified. Keep the trailer storyboard secondary, add tasks for the playable jump and first level, and share the build link. We’ll meet after the next sprint; I look forward to your playable build and devlog updates ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Add a task for the playable jump. Share the public web build link so anyone can test it.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Add a task for the first playable level. Make it accessible in the shared build before spending time on the trailer storyboard.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

